The Mercedes-Benz Vito Progressive is a mid-range trim level for the W447 generation Vito, which received updates in 2019 and 2024. It offers a balance of standard features above the base model.

-   **price_usd**: New prices for a Vito Progressive start around £22,845 excluding VAT (approx $29,000 USD) for a FWD 110 CDI L1 model. Used prices vary, with a 2019 116 CDI Progressive listed around £20,995 + VAT (approx $26,600 USD) and a 2021 114 CDI Progressive listed around £20,394 inc VAT (approx $25,800 USD). Compared to the average new car price (~$52,000), this is significantly lower. Score: 0.60.
